00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:05.672 align:start size:97% position:3%
I like I need to go and
actually read the legislation.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.108
I went in and read it
and it did just that

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:13.013 align:start size:88% position:13%
to somehow believe
that it is a good thing

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.482 align:start size:88% position:13%
to remove all references
