00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:20.487
brother and sister, son and
daughter from essentially

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.324 align:start position:0%
the administration of the house
from the legislative rules.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:29.329
Not only does it not make sense,

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:34.334
it is a dangerous step
towards undermining,

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.907 align:start size:97% position:3%
